        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, column d (right side)",
          "value": "<p></p>\n<ol>\n<li>For \u02bfAbd al-B\u0101q\u012b, 6.</li>\n<li>Total sum, 106\u00bd.</li>\n<li>(Total,) 374.</li>\n<li>To his credit also, for his apartment, 5.</li>\n<li>Cancellation of debt to the above mentioned, 7.</li>\n<li>The small \u1e6dabaqa in D\u0101r al-Zajj\u0101j, 3\u00bd.</li>\n<li>Total sum,</li>\n<li>389\u00bd.</li>\n<li>Still owed by him, 95\u00bd. </li>\n</ol>",
